{"version":1,"key":"card:381","content":{"id":381,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 全局属性值："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"inherit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：继承父元素的属性值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"initial","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：恢复为该属性的默认值"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里需要注意的是恢复为该"},{"type":"formatted","text":"属性的默认值","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而"},{"type":"formatted","text":"不是","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"type":"formatted","text":"该元素的默认值。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签，其 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"display","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"block","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"display","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性的默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"display: initial","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等效于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"display: inline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，与元素无关。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想恢复为元素默认的属性值，应该使用下面的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"revert","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"unset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：这个属性像是未设置过一样，表现为"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于可继承的属性，其